age of total sleep time in stage N3 slow-wave sleep</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">rem-pct<a name=\"sleep-architecture-cs-rem-pct\"> </a></td><td>REM Sleep Percentage</td><td>Percentage of total sleep time in REM sleep</td></tr></table></div>"^^rdf:XMLLiteral ]
